graph TD
    Input[Application State Check Node] --> VersionInput{Requested Version}
    
    VersionInput -->|Explicit Version| AvailCheck[VersionAvailabilityService]
    VersionInput -->|"Latest" or Empty| RedisCheck[Redis Cache Lookup]
    
    AvailCheck -->|AVAILABLE| ExplicitSource[version_resolution_source = 'explicit']
    AvailCheck -->|NOT_AVAILABLE| FallbackSource[version_resolution_source = 'latest_fallback']
    AvailCheck -->|CHECK_FAILED| FailCheck[version_check_unavailable = True]
    
    FallbackSource --> RedisCheck
    
    RedisCheck -->|Cache Hit| UseCache[Use Cached latest_version]
    RedisCheck -->|Cache Miss| Tavily[TavilyService Web Search]
    
    Tavily -->|Search Error| FailCheck
    Tavily -->|Search Success| LLM[LLM Extraction]
    
    LLM -->|High Confidence| SaveCache[Save to Redis]
    LLM -->|Low Confidence/Error| RegexFallback[Regex Extraction Fallback]
    
    RegexFallback -->|Success| SetLatest[discovered_latest_version set]
    RegexFallback -->|Failure| FailCheck
    
    SaveCache --> SetLatest
    UseCache --> SetLatest
    
    ExplicitSource --> VersionDecisionNode[Version Decision Node]
    SetLatest --> VersionDecisionNode
    FailCheck --> EndNode[Notification Node / Failure]
    
    VersionDecisionNode --> CheckInst{Is installed version >= target version?}
    CheckInst -->|Yes| SkipInst[hosts_requiring_installation removed]
    CheckInst -->|No| RequireInst[Proceed with Installation]
